<title>USA: Giant Food Inc Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Giant Food Inc Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.29		    $0.75</p>
<p> Net			 17,689		   44,862</p>
<p> Revs		   1,213,931		1,264,163</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  59,949		   59,501</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 is 16 weeks ended February 22, 1997 vs 16 weeks ended February 24, 1996.</p>
<p>First Call Q4 consensus earnings estimate: $0.41 a share.  </p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.43		    $1.72</p>
<p> Net			  85,04		  102,153</p>
<p> Revs		   3,880,959		3,860,579</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  59,778		   59,360</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for all periods include LIFO charges. Q4 LIFO charge $0.01 per share in 1997 vs $0.02 per share in 1996. Year LIFO charge $0.04 per share in 1997 vs $0.05 a share in 1996.</p>
<p>1997 Q4 and year results hurt by five-week Teamsters Union strike.</p>
